### US-17 — Skriv ut patient
### Satter vardkontaktens status till discharged och fyller i dischargeDate.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@user = adli.test
@pass = ANGE_DITT_LOSENORD_HAR

### 1. Logga in som lakare
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{user}}&password={{pass}}

### 2. Skapa en ny vardkontakt att skriva ut (US-12). Ska ge 201.
POST {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "responsibleStaffId": 1,
  "reason": "Observation over natten"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("ccId", response.body.id);
%}

### 3. HUVUDTESTET — skriv ut utan angivet datum. Ska ge 200 och status discharged.
PATCH {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter/{{ccId}}/utskrivning

> {%
    client.test("200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
    client.test("Status ar discharged", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.status === "discharged", "Status: " + response.body.status);
    });
%}

### 4. FELFALL — skriv ut samma vardkontakt igen. Ska ge 409.
PATCH {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter/{{ccId}}/utskrivning

> {%
    client.test("409 Conflict", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 409, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 5. Skapa en till vardkontakt for att testa angivet datum
POST {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 2,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "responsibleStaffId": 1,
  "reason": "Planerad utskrivning"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("ccId2", response.body.id);
%}

### 6. Skriv ut med angivet datum. Ska ge 200.
PATCH {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter/{{ccId2}}/utskrivning
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dischargeDate": "2026-08-22T14:30:00"
}

> {%
    client.test("200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 7. FELFALL — vardkontakt som inte finns. Ska ge 404.
PATCH {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter/99999/utskrivning

> {%
    client.test("404 Not Found", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 404, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
%}
